/E (Generate AI Blog \(POST /api/ai/generate-blog\): Sends a JSON prompt containing a topic and category. The controller calls the Gemini AI service to synthesize a full-length, structured blog post, saves it directly to MongoDB under the authenticated author, and returns a 201 Created status. )
