/E (Create Blog \(POST /api/blogs\): Passes the JWT Bearer token in the Authorization header alongside a JSON payload with title, content, and category. The server links the post to the logged-in author and returns a 201 Created status with the saved blog document and timestamps. )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [6]
